📈 Future Improvements (Roadmap)
Replace deprecated expo-random with expo-crypto equivalents.
Migrate to newer versions of rimraf and glob (v9+).
Add unit & integration tests with Jest and React Native Testing Library.
Implement offline caching for places data.
